{% extends "eng/_layout.txt.j2" %}
{#- NO_TEXT_DETECTED - document level: readable, but recognition found no text -#}
{% block subject %}We opened your document but found no readable writing in it{% endblock %}
{% block defect %}The document opened correctly, but no readable writing was found inside it.
This happens when the picture is of something other than the document, or
when handwriting is very faint.{% endblock %}
{% block remedy %}Please send a scan of the written or printed pages at {{ recommended_dpi }}
DPI. If your complaint is handwritten, please use dark ink on plain paper
and write in clear, well separated letters.{% endblock %}
